# GitHub Actions VARIABLES specific to THIS repo. Non-sensitive; committed.
#
# The shared defaults (describe model, size/estimate maps, …) live in
# __CI_REPO__'s config/actions.env and are read at run time — they are not
# pushed here. `ebalzan-ci bootstrap` pushes this file as repository variables;
# a key set here overrides the shared one. Every key: __CI_REPO__
# docs/CONFIGURATION.md.
#
# Removing a line does not delete the variable on GitHub; run
# `ebalzan-ci bootstrap --prune`.

# This repo's Projects (v2) board number (owned by the repo owner unless
# AUTO_PROJECT_OWNER says otherwise). Leave unset to run without a board.
# AUTO_PROJECT_NUMBER=

# Milestone put on every work item and promotion PR (exact title, open).
# AUTO_MILESTONE_TITLE=
